**Root cause found.** The frontend reads the per-knot colormap from the field **`color_map`** (snake_case), defaulting to **`"interpolateReds"`** when it's absent:
```js
var n = "interpolateReds";
void 0 != this._knotSpecification.color_map && (n = this._knotSpecification.color_map);
```
My grammar uses `"colorMap"` (camelCase), so every knot falls back to the red default → all five layers red. Let me check whether the grammar interpreter translates `colorMap`→`color_map` anywhere (to be sure of the correct field name).

